:: MP RelDay Sera 9 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜雨轻敲着钟表铺二楼阁楼的斜顶玻璃窗，<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨点轻敲着钟表铺二楼阁楼的斜顶玻璃窗，<<else>>暖光斜照进钟表铺二楼的工作室，<</if>>塞拉在胡桃木桌面上摊开一套双擒纵旅行座钟的蓝晒图，旁边摆着一把精密分规、一只黄铜发条盒与两杯冒着热气的红茶。「这座双摆钟我想留着放在我们床头，帮我核对一下副摆的摆幅好不好？」

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街钟表铺外 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_sera_9 is 1>>
双摆旅行座钟的摆幅今日已与塞拉一同核对妥当，钟声轻柔匀净。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-sera-9">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "用分规量副摆弧度 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-sera-9">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_sera_9 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Sera love 2>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_sera_9_rew")>><<money 420>>分规尖端精准落点，塞拉欣喜地握住你的手背，把一封钟表行会刚结的定制分红塞进你衣袋。<<else>>分规量出的弧度分毫不差，塞拉眉眼弯弯地靠在你肩头。<</if>><span class="green">你们默契无间地定下了床头双摆钟的尺寸。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[留到晚间陪她组装发条盒 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	分规螺母略微松了半扣，量出的刻度偏了半毫米。<span class="red">塞拉温柔地替你拧紧分规螺母。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[锁紧分规转轴重新测量 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回钟表铺一楼前厅 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用绒布擦亮发条盒 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-sera-9">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_sera_9 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Sera love 2>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 2>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_sera_9_rew_alt")>><<money 480>>发条盒擦得澄亮如镜，塞拉顺势将盒底压着的私房礼金塞进你掌心。<<else>>黄铜盒面映出你们相依的身影，阁楼里满是红茶的醇香。<</if>><span class="green">你的体贴照料让塞拉心中暖意融融。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<control 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[约定入夜后一起试听钟声 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	绒布角勾了一下发条盒外的卡簧，发出清脆轻响。<span class="red">塞拉轻笑着按住你的手指。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[放轻手腕力道重新擦拭 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回高街走廊透口气 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Sera 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深人静的钟表铺阁楼点着温暖的煤油台灯，<<else>>灯火柔和的钟表铺阁楼里一片安静，<</if>>塞拉将组装完毕的双摆座钟放在床头柜上，取出一把镶嵌蓝砂石的对表小钥匙与一只丝绒礼金袋放在你手心：「一柄归我，一柄归你，往后每一天的时刻我们都一起上弦。」
桌边还搁着一副擦得透亮的护目镜与一盒备用主发条。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街街面 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_sera_10 is 1>>
床头双摆座钟今日已与塞拉一同上满发条，滴答声伴随着温柔呼吸。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-sera-10">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "用蓝砂石钥匙上发条 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-sera-10">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_sera_10 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Sera love 2>><<mpnpcincr Sera lust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_sera_10_rew")>><<money 460>>双摆同时轻快起振，塞拉红着耳根仰头吻上你的唇角，将丝绒礼金袋塞进你怀里。<<else>>双摆的滴答声交织成安稳的节拍，塞拉紧紧依偎在你怀中。<</if>><span class="green">双摆座钟见证着你们愈发深厚的心意。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收好对表钥匙返回高街 (0:04)|High Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你上弦时手腕微颤，比她的节奏快了半拍。<span class="red">塞拉覆上你的手背带着你放慢速度。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[跟着她的呼吸同步上弦 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回钟表铺楼梯口 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "摘下护目镜揉鼻梁 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-sera-10">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_sera_10 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Sera love 2>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 2>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_sera_10_rew_alt")>><<money 520>>塞拉闭上眼惬意地轻哼一声，反手勾住你的脖颈，把攒下的设计红利交给你保管。<<else>>温暖指腹揉散了她整日的疲惫，她在台灯下望向你的目光盛满眷恋。<</if>><span class="green">阁楼灯影里流淌着只属于你们的脉脉温情。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[与她相拥道别返回高街 (0:04)|High Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你不小心碰到了桌角的放大镜架，发出一声轻响。<span class="red">塞拉睁开眼朝你温柔一笑。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶正放大镜架重新轻揉 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回钟表铺门廊外 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[上阁楼看塞拉做八音盒 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP RelDay Vesper 9 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks_building">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜潮拍打着码头三号干船坞外侧的防波石阶，<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "rain">>冷雨敲打着码头三号干船坞外侧的防波石阶，<<else>>海风吹拂的码头三号干船坞值班室里，<</if>>维斯在航海图桌上铺开一幅标满暗礁与避风港的羊皮海图，旁边摆着一具黄铜六分仪、一支红蓝双色铅笔与一壶热朗姆茶。「我把最安全的几处外海锚地都圈出来了，以后不管风浪多大，这里都有你的落脚处。」

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头栈桥 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_vesper_9 is 1>>
外海避风锚地的羊皮海图今日已与维斯一同标定妥当。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-vesper-9">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "用六分仪核对纬度 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-vesper-9">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_vesper_9 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Vesper love 2>><<mpnpcincr Vesper trust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_vesper_9_rew")>><<money 430>>纬度刻度分毫不差，维斯唇角扬起笑意，将一袋刚分到的远洋领航赏金推到你面前。<<else>>六分仪镜片映出窗外灯塔的光点，维斯赞许地揽住你的肩膀。<</if>><span class="green">你与维斯共同定下了专属的秘密航线。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[留下来陪他夜巡干船坞 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海风吹晃了悬灯，六分仪游标读数晃了一下。<span class="red">维斯抬手替你稳住悬灯铜链。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[扶稳悬灯重新核对刻度 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回船坞值班室门外 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用红蓝笔连补给线 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-vesper-9">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_vesper_9 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Vesper love 2>><<mpnpcincr Vesper trust 2>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_vesper_9_rew_alt")>><<money 490>>补给航线一气呵成，维斯眼底闪过惊艳，从海图筒底层抽出一卷船东红利塞给你。<<else>>清晰的红蓝航线跃然纸上，维斯低头在你发顶落下一吻。<</if>><span class="green">你用周密筹划替维斯省去了大半后顾之忧。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<control 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[约定夜深后去甲板小酌 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铅笔尖在粗糙羊皮结节处顿了一下，折断了半毫米。<span class="red">维斯摸出小刀替你重新削尖笔头。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫平羊皮海图重新勾画 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回码头货运栈桥 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Vesper 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>星光映照的干船坞双桅船船首甲板上，<<else>>海风微凉的干船坞双桅船主桅杆下，<</if>>维斯将自己的防风呢料船长外套披在你肩上，从贴身内袋摸出一枚刻着双锚同心结的纯银方位牌与一袋压舱金币递给你：「只要亮出这枚银牌，港里所有兄弟都会像护着我一样护着你。」
舱角的小炉上温着一壶热朗姆茶。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头街口 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_vesper_10 is 1>>
双锚同心结纯银方位牌今日已贴身收妥，海风里带着维斯外套的松木香。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-vesper-10">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "把皮绳编成双套结 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-vesper-10">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_vesper_10 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Vesper love 2>><<mpnpcincr Vesper lust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_vesper_10_rew")>><<money 470>>双套结紧实利落，维斯顺势握紧你的手按在胸口，将那袋压舱金币塞进你衣袋。<<else>>皮绳结扣稳固妥帖，维斯将你拥进宽阔的怀抱里听海浪拍岸。<</if>><span class="green">海风与星光见证了维斯毫无保留的托付。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收好方位牌返回码头 (0:04)|Docks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海风吹得皮绳尾端微晃，第一道绳圈没能收紧。<span class="red">维斯从身后环住你手把手收紧绳圈。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着他的手劲重新编结 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回双桅船舷梯下 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "端起朗姆茶与他碰杯 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-vesper-10">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_vesper_10 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Vesper love 2>><<mpnpcincr Vesper trust 2>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_vesper_10_rew_alt")>><<money 530>>温热酒液驱散了海雾寒意，维斯低头深深吻住你，将私藏的航运分红悉数交给你。<<else>>朗姆茶的甘甜在唇齿间化开，你们并肩凭栏远眺灯塔。<</if>><span class="green">甲板上的并肩夜饮让彼此心意彻底相通。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<control 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[与维斯道别返回码头 (0:04)|Docks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	朗姆茶热气颇盛，喝得急了些呛红了脸颊。<span class="red">维斯轻拍你的后背替你顺气。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[小口慢抿温热朗姆茶 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回船坞值班室歇脚 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[随维斯进旗舰船长室 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP RelDay Noel 9 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "garden">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.noel to ($mpNpcs.noel or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨丝淅沥的植物园玻璃暖房最深处，<<else>>暖房灯下藤蔓投下斑驳光影，<</if>>诺艾尔在一排白瓷育苗钵前蹲下身，身旁摆着一罐腐殖营养土、一把银柄小园艺铲与一篮刚剪下的白铃兰。「这株双生银脉兰马上就要分株了，我想把靠阳的这一株移进你的专属花钵里。」

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回公园步道 (0:03)|Park]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_noel_9 is 1>>
玻璃暖房的双生银脉兰今日已与诺艾尔一同分株移栽完毕。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-noel-9">
<<tendingicon>><<link "用园艺铲托起兰根 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-noel-9">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_noel_9 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Noel love 2>><<mpnpcincr Noel trust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_noel_9_rew")>><<money 420>>兰根须毫无损伤地移入新钵，诺艾尔开心地弯起眼眸，把植物园刚发的花展奖金分给你。<<else>>双生兰株在白瓷钵里亭亭玉立，诺艾尔感激地蹭了蹭你的指尖。<</if>><span class="green">你们亲手移栽的双生兰株焕发出勃勃生机。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[留下来陪他调配夜间营养液 (0:04)|MP RelDay Noel 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	营养土湿气略重，铲尖带起了一小团黏土。<span class="red">诺艾尔连忙捧住花钵替你托稳根系。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[抖散根部黏土重新移栽 (0:04)|MP RelDay Noel 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回暖房外侧走廊 (0:03)|Park]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
