<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($english or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_noel_10 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Noel love 2>><<mpnpcincr Noel trust 2>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_noel_10_rew_alt")>><<money 520>>甘甜花茶暖透身心，诺艾尔鼓起勇气将头靠在你肩窝，把攒下的培育奖金全交给你。<<else>>洋甘菊的温润香气伴着夜色流淌，你们低声聊着未来的花季。<</if>><span class="green">温馨静谧的茶叙让两颗心贴得愈发紧密。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
