	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[留下来陪他整理晚间脉案 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	风门开得稍大了半分，艾烟升起得略微急促。<span class="red">林恩伸手替你将铜盒风门拨小一格。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[调小铜盒风门重新温灸 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回药房外走廊 (0:03)|Hospital front]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "按病症归类脉案笔记 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-lin-9">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_lin_9 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Lin love 2>><<mpnpcincr Lin trust 2>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_lin_9_rew_alt")>><<money 500>>杂乱笔记转眼理得井井有条，林恩眼底漾起笑意，从抽屉取出一封特批营养补贴塞给你。<<else>>整齐的装订线让翻阅极为顺手，林恩顺势替你擦上清凉薄荷油。<</if>><span class="green">你们默契配合将整季的理疗脉案归档完毕。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<control 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
