:: MP RelDay Ash 9 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜雾弥漫的密林守林人哨屋燃着松木篝火，<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨雾弥漫的密林守林人哨屋燃着松木篝火，<<else>>林间清风拂过守林人木屋前的青石晒台，<</if>>阿什在石台上摆开一张鞣制柔韧的雪鹿皮、一把刻着古符文的骨柄猎刀与一罐防潮蜂蜡膏。「入冬前我想给你缝一副最轻便耐磨的护腕，把手伸出来让我量一量腕围。」

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林外围 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_ash_9 is 1>>
雪鹿皮护腕的尺寸今日已与阿什一同裁定完毕，篝火噼啪作响。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-ash-9">
<<tendingicon>><<link "按住鹿皮顺着画线裁 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-9">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_9 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Ash love 2>><<mpnpcincr Ash trust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_9_rew")>><<money 440>>鹿皮裁口平滑齐整，阿什冷峻的眉眼柔和下来，把猎人公会刚发的巡山赏金塞进你手里。<<else>>骨柄猎刀顺畅滑过皮料，阿什握着你的手腕仔细比对松紧。<</if>><span class="green">你们默契配合裁出了贴合手腕的雪鹿皮护腕。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[留下来陪他守夜烤松鸡 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	鹿皮边缘有一处天然筋结，刀尖走过时略微滞涩。<span class="red">阿什伸手覆上你的手背稳稳推过刀刃。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[避开鹿皮筋结重新裁剪 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回守林木屋门廊下 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用蜂蜡膏擦猎刀鞘 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-9">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_9 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Ash love 2>><<mpnpcincr Ash trust 2>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_9_rew_alt")>><<money 500>>皮鞘吸饱蜂蜡泛出温润光泽，阿什低声道谢，将一袋积攒的珍稀毛皮换来的银币交给你。<<else>>松脂与蜂蜡的清香在火光边萦绕，阿什看你的眼神格外专注。<</if>><span class="green">你的细心照拂让一贯独来独往的阿什倍感安心。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<control 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[约定入夜后在篝火边相伴 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	蜂蜡膏表面凝得略硬，第一抹没能完全推开。<span class="red">阿什将蜡罐凑近篝火替你烘软。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[趁蜂蜡温软重新涂抹皮鞘 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回森林入口石径 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Ash 10 [nobr]
