	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[戴好护腕返回森林外围 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你不小心踩到了壁炉边的干松果，发出一声轻响。<span class="red">阿什眼疾手快地扶住你的腰免得你滑倒。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[踩稳木屋地板重新靠近 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回木屋前晒台 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "盛松针热汤给他 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-10">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_10 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Ash love 2>><<mpnpcincr Ash trust 2>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_10_rew_alt")>><<money 540>>鲜美热汤驱散了深林夜寒，阿什把最嫩的烤肉推给你，又将津贴袋稳稳塞进你行囊。<<else>>木屋里弥漫着诱人的肉香与松针清气，你们并肩坐在兽皮毯上。<</if>><span class="green">篝火木屋里的温暖夜食让彼此心意无比笃定。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[与阿什道别返回森林 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	木汤杓柄受热略烫，端碗时手指缩了一下。<span class="red">阿什立刻接过木碗放在矮几上。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[裹上麻布握住杓柄再盛 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回森林鹿径入口 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
