:: MP Daily Eden 8 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.season is "autumn" or Time.season is "winter">>寒意渐浓的森林木屋前院堆满了过冬的松木柴，<<else>>晨间雾气未散的森林木屋后侧熏肉棚下，<</if>>伊甸正在加固过冬用的樟木储粮窖，旁边放着一桶防潮松脂漆、一把宽刃木工凿与一篮刚采回来的野山核桃。「过来搭把手，把地窖顶盖的防水槽凿深一点，今年冬天就不怕积雪渗水了。」

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林外围 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_eden_8 is 1>>
森林木屋的过冬储粮窖顶盖今日已与伊甸一同加固完毕。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-eden-8">
<<tendingicon>><<link "用木工凿修平导水槽 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-8">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11300 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_8 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 1>><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_eden_8_rew")>><<money 440>>导水槽修得笔直顺畅，伊甸满意地拍了拍你的后颈，把卖猎物换来的一袋零钱塞给你。<<else>>木花成卷落下，伊甸赞许地看了你一眼，顺手剥开两颗山核桃递到你嘴边。<</if>><span class="green">你们齐心协力把木屋过冬的粮窖修得滴水不漏。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[留到傍晚陪伊甸擦拭猎枪 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	樟木节疤处木质极硬，凿刃震得虎口微麻。<span class="red">伊甸伸手握住你的手背一锤将节疤凿平。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个斜角避开节疤再凿 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回木屋前院栅栏边 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用松脂漆涂满接缝 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-8">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_8 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 2>><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_eden_8_rew_alt")>><<money 500>>松脂漆严密覆住每一道缝隙，伊甸难得露出一丝笑意，将多余的皮草款交给你置办冬衣。<<else>>浓郁松脂香封住了木缝，粮窖内壁干燥而温暖。<</if>><span class="green">你细致周到的涂漆手艺让伊甸对你愈发信赖。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<control 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
